msgid "Language"
msgstr "Język"

msgctxt "UILanguageComment"
msgid ""
"Language of the multiplayer interface's text. Until one is picked, it\n"
"follows the game's language."
msgstr ""
"Język tekstów interfejsu trybu wieloosobowego. Dopóki żaden nie zostanie "
"wybrany, jest to język gry."

#. The language's name in itself, so it reads the same in every language
